{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35643","headline":"题李员外厅 · 李山甫","name":"题李员外厅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"石砌蛩吟响，草堂人语稀。\n道孤思绝唱，年长渐知非。\n名利终成患，烟霞亦可依。\n高丘松盖古，闲地药苗肥。\n猨鸟啼嘉景，牛羊傍晚晖。\n幽栖还自得，清啸坐忘机。\n爱彼人深处，白云相伴归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李山甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35643.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35643","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}